> + * MEMBLOCK_RSRV_NOINIT
> + *
>    * @base: the base phys addr of the region
>    * @size: the size of the region
>    *
> - * struct pages will not be initialized for reserved memory regions marked with
> - * %MEMBLOCK_RSRV_NOINIT.
